  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3d8c4219efff6d925b1f5b51a8bb3c15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroManager
  dialogues:
  - name: Voices
    sentences:
    - You know what must be done.
  - name: Voices
    sentences:
    - This is your mission and yours only.
  - name: Voices
    sentences:
    - Do no disappoint us.
  - name: 
    sentences:
    - You find yourself in a greatly illuminated... Ballroom.
    - Your head feels heavy, but a light music is the only sound reaching you apart
      from periodic glass setting sounds, so you find your senses again easily.
    - The big room in front of you seems empty, except from a barmaid behind the
      opposite counter, cleaning her tools.
    - She spots you, stops her action for a moment, but resumes, unalarmed.
    - Too lost to wander on your own, you decide to join her.
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - 'Welcome Player,  I am the one who will accompany you throughout your adventure,
      to guide you and help you make the right choices. '
    - You are going to attend a masked ball that is held every 42 years, but it seems
      you ran here early.
    - To attend this ball, I will let you take this mask.
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - You must keep it on for the entire duration of the event. It is very important. 
      To ensure everyone's anonymity , we ask that you do not remove it.
    - During this ball, various people may approach you.  Your interactions will
      have consequences. Keep that in mind.
    - Keep that in mind. Some interactions will be beneficial  for your relationships
      with the guests attending the evening.
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - Others, if accumulated, could be detrimental to your relationships.
    - You are one of the first people to be here.  I will ask you to wait until all
      the participants are present to start the ball.   While you wait, would you
      like something to drink?
  - name: 
    sentences:
    - You gladly take the free drink, and taste its fruity and herbal flavors. But
      as you turn your head towards the barmaid to thank her, it doesn't look like
      she's open for discussion.
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - Silver, would you like another of the same?
  - name: Silver
    sentences:
    - 'Haha no, I already had one to many, let''s be reasonable. I''ll get some exotic
      juice; guava, passion, mango... What do you got ? '
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - 'You know I can make everything you want.  '
    - 'Oh ... I believe you weren''t introduced. '
    - Player, let me introduce you to Silver, one of the hosts of this place. You
      should thank him for giving you the opportunity to be here.
  - name: Player
    sentences:
    - 'Should I ? I''m still not quite sure why i''m still here. '
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - /annoyed sigh
  - name: Silver
    sentences:
    - Hahaha !! What an interesting lad ! Listen friend, I too am not quite the biggest...
      fan of dance parties either. /* Smiling */
    - But well, you know... responsibilities, all that... What you say, shall we
      go play some games you and I ?
  - name: Player
    sentences:
    - As long as it's less crowded it's fine by me
  - name: Silver
    sentences:
    - ' If a certain person asks for me inform them of my unavailability.'
  - name: Barmaid
    sentences:
    - Very well, I will do so.
